Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.60,Hook,,0,0,0,,¿Cuántas horas sin corriente llevas hoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:00.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sí,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:00.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,mi amor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:01.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,el ventilador te lo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:03.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,llevo hoy mismo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.22,0:00:04.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ay,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:04.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,no,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.84,0:00:05.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,otra vez se fue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:06.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,la corriente.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.10,0:00:08.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tranquila,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.66,0:00:08.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,mami,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:10.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,que yo vine preparado.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:11.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,¿Y eso de dónde
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:12.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,tú lo sacaste?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:13.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,De tu tienda.
